---
title: "discord_oauth_login (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: user clicks login
    q_init --> q_redirect: redirect to Discord OAuth via Supabase Auth
    q_redirect --> q_callback: Discord returns auth code
    q_callback --> q_validate: Supabase exchanges code for token
    q_validate --> q_check_user: validate token success
    q_validate --> q_error: validate token failure
    q_check_user --> q_create_profile: user not in DB
    q_check_user --> q_session: user exists in DB
    q_create_profile --> q_session: insert member record with Discord info
    q_session --> [*]: return authenticated session
    q_error --> [*]: return auth error

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: OAuth token must be validated server-side via Supabase before granting session
        INV-002: Auth code exchange must use secure server-to-server channel
    end note

    note right of q_check_user
        INV-003: New users must have a member profile created on first login
    end note
